      "id": "claim_f0fc7c98963042cab16b3193617695fb",
      "statement": "ActionDefinition entries in the catalog carry Name, Description, Type (openapi.Read/openapi.Write), Scope (openapi.KubeApi being the only scope any current cataloged action uses), AllowedRoles, ParamDefinitions, and optional DryRunAction/WriteCooldownSeconds/Approval fields that support dry-run pairing, write rate limiting, and an approval requirement.",
