    {
      "id": "claim_6ce096cc28f2480e8643b73491783659",
      "statement": "Trusted Actions' own Containerfile at components/trusted-actions/Containerfile is a distinct, much simpler image from the repository-root Containerfile: a two-stage build (registry.access.redhat.com/hi/go builder stage running `go build ./cmd/server`, then a registry.access.redhat.com/hi/core-runtime runtime stage pinned by digest) that copies in only the compiled rosa-trusted-actions-server binary, EXPOSEs port 8080, and runs as non-root USER 1001 with ENTRYPOINT [\"rosa-trusted-actions-server\"]; the root Containerfile instead builds Boundary's multi-stage SRE-tools investigation container and has no stage, binary, or purpose in common with it.",
